	'how_figs_p' => 'Site measure: 45 min. Written quote: 3 working days. Fitting: 1 day per standard bay. A standard bay is up to 5 m wide. Wider or fire-rated openings take two fitting days. Manufacture sits behind those three figures: 10 to 15 working days, or 20 working days for a fire-rated shutter. The aftercare visit is at 12 months. One visit, one written quote, one fitting day, for loading bays, shopfronts and service hatches. The same three figures are what we tell you before we book the measure.',
