	'how_s1_p1' => 'The site measure takes 45 minutes. We arrive and sign in. Width is taken three times and height twice. We check headroom and side room for the drum. We photograph the guide rails, the drum and the power supply, and we photograph the rails, the motor and the isolator.',
	'how_s1_p2' => 'We talk to the person who opens the door every morning, because the person who uses the door knows where it sticks. We leave with nothing promised that has not been measured. The visit and the written quote are free within 25 km. Beyond 25 km the visit is €60, credited on the order.',
	'how_s2_p1' => 'The written quote arrives within 3 working days. It says what we will make, what we will take away and which day we can fit it. A quote includes the visit, the new door, fitting, removal and recycling of the old one, and an aftercare visit at 12 months.',
	'how_s2_p2' => 'Prices exclude VAT. The quote is valid for 60 days. Nothing is ordered until you have read it. Priya Venn sends the day\'s written quotes at 13:00. If you accept, the order takes a 30 percent deposit and the balance is due on the fitting day.',
	'how_s3_p1' => 'Manufacture takes 10 to 15 working days after the quote is signed. A fire-rated shutter takes 20 working days. We agree the fitting day before manufacture starts, so the door is not on the bench for a day the site cannot open a bay.',
