	'nl_title' => 'Survey-day list',
	'no_posts' => 'Nothing has been posted here yet.',
	'nt1' => 'A quote includes the visit, the new door, fitting, removal and recycling of the old one, and an aftercare visit at 12 months.',
	'nt2' => 'Standard bays up to 5 m wide are fitted in one day; we close one bay at a time so you can keep loading.',
	'nt3' => 'Emergency call-outs for a shutter stuck open or shut: same day within 25 km, Monday to Saturday.',
	'os_h' => 'On site',
	'os_p1' => 'We arrive in one of the two vans and sign in with the person on the gate, the shop floor or the school office. The visit is 45 minutes. We confirm which opening is to be replaced, whether the door is working, stuck open or stuck shut, and who needs the bay that day. Where there is more than one opening we agree the order before we start, because a fitting day closes one bay at a time.',
	'os_p2' => 'Width is taken three times and height twice, on the structural opening rather than on a frame that is coming out. We check headroom and side room for the drum, and we note a beam, a conduit or a dock shelter if it sits in the way of the barrel or the guide rails. A laser distance measurer and a steel tape are both used, and the two readings have to agree before a figure is written down.',
	'os_p3' => 'We photograph the guide rails, the motor and the isolator, and the power supply where the new door will be electric. Then we talk to the person who opens the door every morning: the person who uses the door knows where it sticks. We leave with nothing promised that has not been measured. The written quote follows within three working days, and nothing is ordered until you have read it.',
	'pr1_d' => 'Visit, photos and a written quote. Free within 25 km; €60 beyond, credited on order.',
	'pr1_i' => 'Site measure and written quote',
	'pr1_p' => 'Free',
	'pr2_d' => 'Shutter, fitting and removal of the old one.',
	'pr2_i' => 'Manual roller shutter, shopfront up to 3 × 2.5 m',
	'pr2_p' => '€1,480',
	'pr3_d' => 'Shutter, motor, controls, fitting and removal.',
	'pr3_i' => 'Electric roller shutter, bay up to 4 × 4.5 m',
