	'pr_h' => 'Prices',
	'pr_note' => 'Prices exclude VAT. Every fitted door includes removal and recycling of the old one and an aftercare visit at 12 months. A quote is valid for 60 days; the deposit is 30 percent on order, and the balance is due on the fitting day. An emergency call-out is €120.',
	'pr_th_d' => 'What\'s included',
	'pr_th_i' => 'Item',
	'pr_th_p' => 'From',
	'prices_h_never' => 'Never extra',
	'prices_h_sv' => 'The yearly service visit',
	'prices_h_table' => 'Seven prices, written down',
	'prices_lead' => 'Seven prices, all excluding VAT, all written as a from-figure. The site measure and written quote are free within 25 km of Wrenfield. Every fitted door includes removal and recycling of the old one and an aftercare visit at 12 months.',
	'prices_nt1' => 'The site measure and written quote are free within 25 km of Wrenfield. Beyond 25 km the visit is €60, and that €60 is credited on the order.',
	'prices_nt1_t' => 'Site measure and quote',
	'prices_nt2' => 'Removal and recycling of the old door are part of every fitted-door price.',
	'prices_nt2_t' => 'Removal and recycling',
	'prices_nt3' => 'The aftercare visit at 12 months is included with every fitted door.',
	'prices_nt3_t' => 'Aftercare visit',
	'prices_nv_p1' => 'Three items are not added on the fitting day.',
	'prices_nv_p2' => 'A yearly service visit after that year is a separate line, from €140 per door. An emergency call-out is also separate: €120, same day within 25 km, Monday to Saturday, 7:00 to 19:00, for a shutter stuck open or shut.',
	'prices_sv_p1' => 'A yearly service visit is from €140 per door, excluding VAT. It covers inspection, lubrication, adjustment and a written report. It is not the aftercare visit at 12 months, which is already included when we fit a door. Lena Brandt arranges both from the service desk.',
	'prices_sv_p2' => 'We order a new door only after a signed quote, and we agree the fitting day before manufacture starts. The same rule sits behind a motor replacement: from €690, including the motor, the controls and testing, and only after the shutter has been looked at. Book a site measure and the written quote sets out which of these lines apply.',
	'prices_terms' => 'Prices exclude VAT. A quote is valid for 60 days. The order takes a 30 percent deposit. The balance is due on the fitting day. Manufacture is 10 to 15 working days, or 20 working days for a fire-rated shutter.',
	'prices_title' => 'Prices',
	'privacy_h1' => 'What you send when you book',
	'privacy_h2' => 'The survey-day list',
	'privacy_h3' => 'Who holds the details',
	'privacy_lead' => 'This note says what Makido Shutters collects when you book a site measure or join the survey-day list, and what we use it for. The contact details at the end are the ones to use if you want a copy or a correction.',
	'privacy_s1_p1' => 'The booking form asks for your full name, company, email, phone, and site address or postcode. It asks for the door type, the number of openings, the approximate width and height, your preferred visit days from Monday to Friday, whether the door is working, stuck open or stuck shut, and a message.',
	'privacy_s1_p2' => 'A consent box sits with the form and points at this page. We use those details to reply within one working day with two visit times, to carry out the 45-minute site measure, and to write the quote within 3 working days. We do not use them for a mailing you did not ask for. Photographs you email for a door we cannot name are kept with that enquiry.',
	'privacy_s2_p1' => 'The survey-day list asks for an email address. Joining it means you have sent a message to quotes@makido-shutters.example. Until that message is sent, you are not on the list. We use the address to send open survey days, lead-time changes, and one short job note a month.',
	'privacy_s2_p2' => 'We do not pass the list to another firm. You can ask to be taken off it by writing to the same address. A booking and a list signup are separate. Asking for a site measure does not put you on the list, and joining the list does not book a visit.',
	'privacy_s3_p1' => 'Makido Shutters, Unit 4, Brannock Works, 22 Kestle Road, Wrenfield. Phone 021 480 1948. Email quotes@makido-shutters.example. The office is open Monday to Friday, 7:30 to 17:00. Priya Venn handles quotes and scheduling. Lena Brandt handles aftercare and the service desk.',
	'privacy_s3_p2' => 'Ask either of them, through the phone or the email above, if you want to see what we hold from your enquiry or if you want it corrected. We keep an enquiry for as long as the quote is valid, which is 60 days, and for as long as a fitted door\'s aftercare visit at 12 months, or a yearly service you have booked, still needs it.',
	'privacy_title' => 'Privacy',
	'q_h' => 'What a quote includes',
	'q_h2' => 'A standard bay, in figures',
	'q_note' => 'Standard bay: up to 5 m wide. Wider or fire-rated openings take two fitting days.',
	'q_p' => 'We come out, measure the opening three times, photograph the guide rails, the drum and the power supply, and write down exactly what we will make, what we will take away and which day we can fit it. Nothing is ordered until you have read it.',
	'q_stmt' => 'One visit, one written quote, one fitting day.',
	'q_sub' => 'for loading bays, shopfronts and service hatches',
	'search_results' => 'Search results for: %s',
	'terms_h1' => 'The quote',
	'terms_h2' => 'The order and the fitting day',
	'terms_h3' => 'Call-outs, service and the price list',
	'terms_lead' => 'These terms cover a written quote, an order and a fitting day with Makido Shutters. The figures are the same ones on the prices page. Prices exclude VAT.',
	'terms_s1_p1' => 'A written quote is valid for 60 days. It follows the site measure within 3 working days. It states what we will make, what we will take away and which day we can fit it. The site measure and the written quote are free within 25 km of Wrenfield. Beyond 25 km the visit is €60, credited on the order.',
	'terms_s1_p2' => 'Nothing is ordered until you have read the quote. If the opening is wider than a standard bay of 5 m, or if the door is fire-rated, the quote will say so, because those openings take two fitting days and a fire-rated shutter takes 20 working days to manufacture.',
	'terms_s2_p1' => 'An order takes a 30 percent deposit. The balance is due on the fitting day. We agree the fitting day before manufacture starts. Manufacture takes 10 to 15 working days, or 20 working days for a fire-rated shutter. Fitting is one day per standard bay up to 5 m wide, and two days for a wider opening or a fire-rated opening.',
	'terms_s2_p2' => 'We close one bay at a time so the site can keep loading. Every fitted door includes removal and recycling of the old one and an aftercare visit at 12 months. Work is carried out within 60 km of Wrenfield. The workshop is Unit 4, Brannock Works, 22 Kestle Road, Wrenfield.',
	'terms_s3_p1' => 'An emergency call-out for a shutter stuck open or shut is €120. It is available the same day within 25 km, Monday to Saturday, 7:00 to 19:00. It is not a deposit and it is not included in a door price. A yearly service visit is from €140 per door and covers inspection, lubrication, adjustment and a report.',
	'terms_s3_p2' => 'A motor replacement on an existing shutter is from €690, including the motor, the controls and testing. Door prices, from €1,480 for a manual shopfront shutter up to 3 × 2.5 m through to €6,800 for a fire-rated roller shutter up to 3 × 3 m, are the from-prices on the prices page and exclude VAT. The written quote for your opening is the price that applies to the order.',
	'terms_title' => 'Terms',
	'thanks_back' => 'Back to the home page',
	'thanks_h1' => 'Two visit times',
	'thanks_h2' => 'Back to the start',
	'thanks_lead' => 'We\'ll reply within one working day with two visit times. The message has reached Makido Shutters, and the diary is the next step.',
	'thanks_s1_p1' => 'Thank you for asking for a site measure. We\'ll reply within one working day with two visit times. Survey visits run Monday to Friday, 7:30 to 16:00. The visit takes 45 minutes. Bring access to the bay, have the power isolated, and have someone with the keys on site.',
	'thanks_s1_p2' => 'If the door is stuck open or stuck shut and you need someone the same day within 25 km, that is an emergency call-out on 021 480 1948, Monday to Saturday, 7:00 to 19:00, at €120, and it is separate from this booking. The office email is quotes@makido-shutters.example.',
	'thanks_s2_p1' => 'You can return to the home page while you wait. The quote section sets out what the written quote includes, and the prices page lists the seven from-prices, all excluding VAT. Nothing is ordered from this message. When you have read the quote, the order is a 30 percent deposit, and the balance is due on the fitting day.',
	'thanks_s2_p2' => 'The quote will be valid for 60 days. If you also want next month\'s open survey days, the survey-day list is separate, and you are not on it until you send that message yourself. Unit 4, Brannock Works, 22 Kestle Road, Wrenfield.',
	'thanks_title' => 'Thanks',
	'wk1_m' => 'Cold store · 3 sectional doors · 3 days',
	'wk1_t' => 'Harbour Lane Cold Store',
	'wk1_x' => 'Harbour Lane Cold Store needed three insulated sectional doors on its loading bays. We measured the openings on a Tuesday and fitted the doors over three days, closing one bay at a time so the store could keep loading.',
	'wk2_m' => 'Hardware shop · manual to electric · 1 day',
	'wk2_t' => 'Corrie & Sons Hardware',
	'wk2_x' => 'Corrie & Sons Hardware changed a manual shopfront shutter to an electric one. We fitted the shutter, motor and controls in one day and finished before opening time, with the old shutter taken away the same day.',
	'wk3_m' => 'School kitchen · counter shutter · 1 day',
	'wk3_t' => 'Westmoor Primary School kitchen',
	'wk3_x' => 'Westmoor Primary School kitchen needed a counter shutter on the servery hatch. We fitted it in one day during the half-term break; the opening was measured before the shutter was made, and the quote named that fitting day.',
	'wk_h' => 'Recent work',
	'wordmark' => 'Makido Shutters',
	'work_c1_m' => 'Measured on a Tuesday · Quoted within 3 working days · Fitted over three days, one bay at a time',
	'work_c1_p1' => 'Harbour Lane Cold Store needed three insulated sectional doors on its loading bays. We measured the three openings on a Tuesday. Width was taken three times and height twice on each bay, with headroom and side room checked for the tracks and the motor. The written quote followed within 3 working days. It named what we would make, what we would take away and which days we could fit. Manufacture started only after that quote was signed and the fitting days were agreed.',
	'work_c1_p2' => 'Fitting took three days. We closed one bay at a time so the store could keep loading through the other two. An insulated sectional overhead door up to 4 × 4.5 m is from €5,200, excluding VAT, including the door, tracks, motor, fitting and removal. This job was priced from the Tuesday sheets, not by copying the table. Removal and recycling of the old doors were included. An aftercare visit is at 12 months.',
	'work_c1_t' => 'Harbour Lane Cold Store',
	'work_c2_m' => 'Measured before the order · Quoted within 3 working days · Fitted in one day, before opening time',
	'work_c2_p1' => 'Corrie & Sons Hardware changed a manual shopfront shutter to an electric one. We measured the shopfront before anything was ordered: the opening, the guide rails, the drum and the power supply, plus the motor position and the isolator. The person who opens the shop in the morning was there, because the person who uses the door knows where it sticks. The written quote arrived within 3 working days and named the electric shutter, the motor, the controls, removal of the old manual shutter and the fitting day.',
	'work_c2_p2' => 'We agreed that day before manufacture started. Manufacture took its place in the usual 10 to 15 working days. Fitting was one day, and it was finished before opening time, so the shop could trade on that door the same morning. An electric roller shutter for a bay up to 4 × 4.5 m is from €3,950, excluding VAT. The hardware shop was quoted to its own measured opening. A standard bay up to 5 m wide is one fitting day. Removal, recycling and an aftercare visit at 12 months were included.',
	'work_c2_t' => 'Corrie & Sons Hardware',
	'work_c3_m' => 'Measured to the hatch · Quoted within 3 working days · Fitted in one day during the half-term break',
	'work_c3_p1' => 'Westmoor Primary School kitchen needed a counter shutter on the servery hatch. We measured the hatch, the side room and the way the shutter had to sit over the stainless counter. The written quote followed within 3 working days and named the shutter, removal of the old one and a single fitting day. The school asked for that day in the half-term break, and we agreed it before manufacture started.',
	'work_c3_p2' => 'Manufacture sat inside the usual 10 to 15 working days for a shutter that is not fire-rated. Fitting took one day, while the kitchen was on its break, and the crew tested the shutter before they left. There is no separate from-price for a counter shutter. The figure was the one on the written quote. Removal and recycling of the old shutter were included, and an aftercare visit is booked at 12 months. The service desk, Lena Brandt, holds that date.',
	'work_c3_t' => 'Westmoor Primary School kitchen',
	'work_h_band' => 'Measured before it was made',
	'work_lead' => 'Three recent jobs: a cold store, a hardware shop and a school kitchen. Each one was measured before it was made, and each fitting day was agreed before manufacture started.',
	'work_title' => 'Our work',
);
